109
00:06:51.576 --> 00:06:52.600
Memulai Operasi

110
00:06:52.643 --> 00:06:55.168
Langkah pertama adalah menghentikan mesin.

111
00:06:55.213 --> 00:06:56.908
Berdiri di sana, komandan

112
00:06:56.948 --> 00:06:57.972
Komputer Lantree

113
